{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 18,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 592.311,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.201,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that king Lamoni caused that his servants should stand forth",
      "verse": "18:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.381,
      "end": 9.932,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and testify to all the things which they had seen concerning the matter.",
      "verse": "18:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 10.612,
      "end": 14.141,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when they had all testified to the things which they had seen,",
      "verse": "18:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 14.321,
      "end": 18.826,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he had learned of the faithfulness of Ammon in preserving his flocks,",
      "verse": "18:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 19.006,
      "end": 23.464,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also of his great power in contending against those who sought to slay him,",
      "verse": "18:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 23.644,
      "end": 25.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he was astonished exceedingly, and said:",
      "verse": "18:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 26.146,
      "end": 28.422,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Surely, this is more than a man.",
      "verse": "18:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 28.602,
      "end": 30.878,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, is not this the Great Spirit",
      "verse": "18:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 31.058,
      "end": 36.538,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who doth send such great punishments upon this people, because of their murders?",
      "verse": "18:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 37.218,
      "end": 39.215,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they answered the king, and said:",
      "verse": "18:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 39.395,
      "end": 42.924,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Whether he be the Great Spirit or a man, we know not;",
      "verse": "18:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 43.104,
      "end": 48.677,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but this much we do know, that he cannot be slain by the enemies of the king;",
      "verse": "18:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 48.857,
      "end": 54.801,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither can they scatter the king's flocks when he is with us, because of his expertness and great strength;",
      "verse": "18:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 54.981,
      "end": 57.767,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, we know that he is a friend to the king.",
      "verse": "18:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 57.947,
      "end": 62.312,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, O king, we do not believe that a man has such great power,",
      "verse": "18:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 62.492,
      "end": 64.814,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for we know he cannot be slain.",
      "verse": "18:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 65.494,
      "end": 67.816,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, when the king heard these words,",
      "verse": "18:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 67.996,
      "end": 69.621,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he said unto them:",
      "verse": "18:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 69.801,
      "end": 72.402,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now I know that it is the Great Spirit;",
      "verse": "18:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 72.582,
      "end": 75.972,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he has come down at this time to preserve your lives,",
      "verse": "18:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 76.152,
      "end": 79.356,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I might not slay you as I did your brethren.",
      "verse": "18:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 79.536,
      "end": 83.065,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this is the Great Spirit of whom our fathers have spoken.",
      "verse": "18:4",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 83.745,
      "end": 87.832,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this was the tradition of Lamoni, which he had received from his father,",
      "verse": "18:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 88.012,
      "end": 90.009,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that there was a Great Spirit.",
      "verse": "18:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 90.189,
      "end": 93.022,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Notwithstanding they believed in a Great Spirit,",
      "verse": "18:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 93.202,
      "end": 96.36,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they supposed that whatsoever they did was right;",
      "verse": "18:5",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 96.54,
      "end": 103.413,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, Lamoni began to fear exceedingly, with fear lest he had done wrong in slaying his servants;",
      "verse": "18:5",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 104.093,
      "end": 106.276,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For he had slain many of them",
      "verse": "18:6",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 106.456,
      "end": 111.379,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because their brethren had scattered their flocks at the place of water;",
      "verse": "18:6",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 111.559,
      "end": 116.528,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus, because they had had their flocks scattered they were slain.",
      "verse": "18:6",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 117.208,
      "end": 124.406,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now it was the practice of these Lamanites to stand by the waters of Sebus to scatter the flocks of the people,",
      "verse": "18:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 124.586,
      "end": 129.323,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby they might drive away many that were scattered unto their own land,",
      "verse": "18:7",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 129.503,
      "end": 132.197,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it being a practice of plunder among them.",
      "verse": "18:7",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 132.877,
      "end": 137.057,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that king Lamoni inquired of his servants, saying:",
      "verse": "18:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 137.237,
      "end": 139.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Where is this man that has such great power?",
      "verse": "18:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 140.471,
      "end": 142.096,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they said unto him:",
      "verse": "18:9",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 142.276,
      "end": 144.319,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, he is feeding thy horses.",
      "verse": "18:9",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 144.499,
      "end": 154.809,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the king had commanded his servants, previous to the time of the watering of their flocks, that they should prepare his horses and chariots,",
      "verse": "18:9",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 154.989,
      "end": 157.636,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and conduct him forth to the land of Nephi;",
      "verse": "18:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 157.816,
      "end": 163.853,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for there had been a great feast appointed at the land of Nephi, by the father of Lamoni,",
      "verse": "18:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 164.033,
      "end": 166.355,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who was king over all the land.",
      "verse": "18:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 167.035,
      "end": 172.004,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when king Lamoni heard that Ammon was preparing his horses and his chariots",
      "verse": "18:10",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 172.184,
      "end": 176.735,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he was more astonished, because of the faithfulness of Ammon, saying:",
      "verse": "18:10",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 176.915,
      "end": 180.909,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Surely there has not been any servant among all my servants",
      "verse": "18:10",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 181.089,
      "end": 183.365,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that has been so faithful as this man;",
      "verse": "18:10",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 183.545,
      "end": 187.632,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for even he doth remember all my commandments to execute them.",
      "verse": "18:10",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 188.312,
      "end": 191.145,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now I surely know that this is the Great Spirit,",
      "verse": "18:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 191.325,
      "end": 195.551,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I would desire him that he come in unto me, but I durst not.",
      "verse": "18:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 196.231,
      "end": 201.247,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when Ammon had made ready the horses and the chariots",
      "verse": "18:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 201.427,
      "end": 204.864,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the king and his servants, he went in unto the king,",
      "verse": "18:12",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 205.044,
      "end": 208.388,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he saw that the countenance of the king was changed;",
      "verse": "18:12",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 208.568,
      "end": 212.097,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he was about to return out of his presence.",
      "verse": "18:12",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 212.777,
      "end": 215.238,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And one of the king's servants said unto him,",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 215.418,
      "end": 216.44,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Rabbanah,",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 216.62,
      "end": 223.354,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is, being interpreted, powerful or great king, considering their kings to be powerful;",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 223.534,
      "end": 225.345,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus he said unto him:",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 225.525,
      "end": 228.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Rabbanah, the king desireth thee to stay.",
      "verse": "18:13",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 228.806,
      "end": 231.592,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore Ammon turned himself unto the king,",
      "verse": "18:14",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 231.772,
      "end": 233.351,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and said unto him:",
      "verse": "18:14",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 233.531,
      "end": 236.41,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "What wilt thou that I should do for thee, O king?",
      "verse": "18:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 236.59,
      "end": 240.77,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the king answered him not for the space of an hour, according to their time,",
      "verse": "18:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 240.95,
      "end": 243.644,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he knew not what he should say unto him.",
      "verse": "18:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 244.324,
      "end": 247.853,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Ammon said unto him again:",
      "verse": "18:15",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 248.033,
      "end": 249.751,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "What desirest thou of me?",
      "verse": "18:15",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 249.931,
      "end": 251.928,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But the king answered him not.",
      "verse": "18:15",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 252.608,
      "end": 256.509,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Ammon, being filled with the Spirit of God,",
      "verse": "18:16",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 256.689,
      "end": 259.8,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he perceived the thoughts of the king.",
      "verse": "18:16",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 259.98,
      "end": 261.652,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said unto him:",
      "verse": "18:16",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 261.832,
      "end": 262.714,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Is it",
      "verse": "18:16",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 262.894,
      "end": 267.074,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because thou hast heard that I defended thy servants and thy flocks,",
      "verse": "18:16",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 267.254,
      "end": 271.155,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and slew seven of their brethren with the sling and with the sword,",
      "verse": "18:16",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 271.335,
      "end": 276.165,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and smote off the arms of others, in order to defend thy flocks and thy servants;",
      "verse": "18:16",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 276.345,
      "end": 279.178,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, is it this that causeth thy marvelings?",
      "verse": "18:16",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 279.858,
      "end": 281.344,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you,",
      "verse": "18:17",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 281.524,
      "end": 284.357,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "what is it, that thy marvelings are so great?",
      "verse": "18:17",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 284.537,
      "end": 287.138,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I am a man, and am thy servant;",
      "verse": "18:17",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 287.318,
      "end": 291.59,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, whatsoever thou desirest which is right, that will I do.",
      "verse": "18:17",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 292.27,
      "end": 295.707,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when the king had heard these words, he marveled again,",
      "verse": "18:18",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 295.887,
      "end": 300.02,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he beheld that Ammon could discern his thoughts;",
      "verse": "18:18",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 300.2,
      "end": 303.869,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but notwithstanding this, king Lamoni did open his mouth,",
      "verse": "18:18",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 304.049,
      "end": 305.628,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and said unto him:",
      "verse": "18:18",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 305.808,
      "end": 306.923,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Who art thou?",
      "verse": "18:18",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 307.103,
      "end": 310.307,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Art thou that Great Spirit, who knows all things?",
      "verse": "18:18",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 310.987,
      "end": 313.355,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ammon answered and said unto him:",
      "verse": "18:19",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 313.535,
      "end": 314.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I am not.",
      "verse": "18:19",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 315.376,
      "end": 316.816,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the king said:",
      "verse": "18:20",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 316.996,
      "end": 319.597,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "How knowest thou the thoughts of my heart?",
      "verse": "18:20",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 319.777,
      "end": 321.542,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou mayest speak boldly,",
      "verse": "18:20",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 321.722,
      "end": 324.09,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and tell me concerning these things;",
      "verse": "18:20",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 324.27,
      "end": 326.453,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also tell me by what power",
      "verse": "18:20",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 326.633,
      "end": 331.184,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye slew and smote off the arms of my brethren that scattered my flocks\u2014",
      "verse": "18:20",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 331.864,
      "end": 334.79,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, if thou wilt tell me concerning these things,",
      "verse": "18:21",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 334.97,
      "end": 338.174,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whatsoever thou desirest I will give unto thee;",
      "verse": "18:21",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 338.354,
      "end": 342.209,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and if it were needed, I would guard thee with my armies;",
      "verse": "18:21",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 342.389,
      "end": 345.361,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but I know that thou art more powerful than all they;",
      "verse": "18:21",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 345.541,
      "end": 348.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, whatsoever thou desirest of me",
      "verse": "18:21",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 348.786,
      "end": 350.597,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will grant it unto thee.",
      "verse": "18:21",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 351.277,
      "end": 353.599,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now Ammon being wise, yet harmless,",
      "verse": "18:22",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 353.779,
      "end": 355.404,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he said unto Lamoni:",
      "verse": "18:22",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 355.584,
      "end": 357.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wilt thou hearken unto my words,",
      "verse": "18:22",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 358.04,
      "end": 360.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if I tell thee by what power I do these things?",
      "verse": "18:22",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 361.146,
      "end": 363.747,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And this is the thing that I desire of thee.",
      "verse": "18:22",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 364.427,
      "end": 366.656,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the king answered him, and said:",
      "verse": "18:23",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 366.836,
      "end": 369.112,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I will believe all thy words.",
      "verse": "18:23",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 369.292,
      "end": 371.521,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus he was caught with guile.",
      "verse": "18:23",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 372.201,
      "end": 375.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Ammon began to speak unto him with boldness,",
      "verse": "18:24",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 375.4,
      "end": 376.979,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and said unto him:",
      "verse": "18:24",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 377.159,
      "end": 379.295,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Believest thou that there is a God?",
      "verse": "18:24",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 379.975,
      "end": 382.065,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he answered, and said unto him:",
      "verse": "18:25",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 382.245,
      "end": 384.288,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I do not know what that meaneth.",
      "verse": "18:25",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 384.968,
      "end": 386.64,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then Ammon said:",
      "verse": "18:26",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 386.82,
      "end": 389.281,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Believest thou that there is a Great Spirit?",
      "verse": "18:26",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 389.961,
      "end": 391.168,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said, Yea.",
      "verse": "18:27",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 391.848,
      "end": 393.288,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Ammon said:",
      "verse": "18:28",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 393.468,
      "end": 394.629,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "This is God.",
      "verse": "18:28",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 394.809,
      "end": 396.945,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Ammon said unto him again:",
      "verse": "18:28",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 397.125,
      "end": 403.394,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Believest thou that this Great Spirit, who is God, created all things which are in heaven and in the earth?",
      "verse": "18:28",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 404.074,
      "end": 405.374,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said:",
      "verse": "18:29",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 405.554,
      "end": 409.641,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I believe that he created all things which are in the earth;",
      "verse": "18:29",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 409.821,
      "end": 411.771,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but I do not know the heavens.",
      "verse": "18:29",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 412.451,
      "end": 414.309,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Ammon said unto him:",
      "verse": "18:30",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 414.489,
      "end": 418.158,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The heavens is a place where God dwells and all his holy angels.",
      "verse": "18:30",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 418.838,
      "end": 420.51,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And king Lamoni said:",
      "verse": "18:31",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 420.69,
      "end": 422.315,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Is it above the earth?",
      "verse": "18:31",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 422.995,
      "end": 424.435,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Ammon said:",
      "verse": "18:32",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 424.615,
      "end": 427.866,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and he looketh down upon all the children of men;",
      "verse": "18:32",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 428.046,
      "end": 431.297,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he knows all the thoughts and intents of the heart;",
      "verse": "18:32",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 431.477,
      "end": 434.867,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for by his hand were they all created from the beginning.",
      "verse": "18:32",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 435.547,
      "end": 437.219,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And king Lamoni said:",
      "verse": "18:33",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 437.399,
      "end": 440.185,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I believe all these things which thou hast spoken.",
      "verse": "18:33",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 440.365,
      "end": 441.898,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Art thou sent from God?",
      "verse": "18:33",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 442.578,
      "end": 444.203,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ammon said unto him:",
      "verse": "18:34",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 444.383,
      "end": 445.59,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I am a man;",
      "verse": "18:34",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 445.77,
      "end": 449.764,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and man in the beginning was created after the image of God,",
      "verse": "18:34",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 449.944,
      "end": 454.356,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I am called by his Holy Spirit to teach these things unto this people,",
      "verse": "18:34",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 454.536,
      "end": 459.412,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may be brought to a knowledge of that which is just and true;",
      "verse": "18:34",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 460.092,
      "end": 462.832,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And a portion of that Spirit dwelleth in me,",
      "verse": "18:35",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 463.012,
      "end": 469.328,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which giveth me knowledge, and also power according to my faith and desires which are in God.",
      "verse": "18:35",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 470.008,
      "end": 477.113,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when Ammon had said these words, he began at the creation of the world, and also the creation of Adam,",
      "verse": "18:36",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 477.293,
      "end": 480.544,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and told him all the things concerning the fall of man,",
      "verse": "18:36",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 480.724,
      "end": 486.204,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and rehearsed and laid before him the records and the holy scriptures of the people,",
      "verse": "18:36",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 486.384,
      "end": 488.66,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which had been spoken by the prophets,",
      "verse": "18:36",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 488.84,
      "end": 492.555,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even down to the time that their father, Lehi, left Jerusalem.",
      "verse": "18:36",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 493.235,
      "end": 495.65,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also rehearsed unto them",
      "verse": "18:37",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 495.83,
      "end": 498.756,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "(for it was unto the king and to his servants)",
      "verse": "18:37",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 498.936,
      "end": 502.233,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "all the journeyings of their fathers in the wilderness,",
      "verse": "18:37",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 502.413,
      "end": 505.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all their sufferings with hunger and thirst,",
      "verse": "18:37",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 505.658,
      "end": 507.887,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their travail, and so forth.",
      "verse": "18:37",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 508.567,
      "end": 515.672,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also rehearsed unto them concerning the rebellions of Laman and Lemuel, and the sons of Ishmael,",
      "verse": "18:38",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 515.852,
      "end": 519.196,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, all their rebellions did he relate unto them;",
      "verse": "18:38",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 519.376,
      "end": 526.667,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he expounded unto them all the records and scriptures from the time that Lehi left Jerusalem down to the present time.",
      "verse": "18:38",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 527.347,
      "end": 528.926,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But this is not all;",
      "verse": "18:39",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 529.106,
      "end": 532.403,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he expounded unto them the plan of redemption,",
      "verse": "18:39",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 532.583,
      "end": 535.973,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was prepared from the foundation of the world;",
      "verse": "18:39",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 536.153,
      "end": 540.008,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he also made known unto them concerning the coming of Christ,",
      "verse": "18:39",
      "lineIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "start": 540.188,
      "end": 543.207,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all the works of the Lord did he make known unto them.",
      "verse": "18:39",
      "lineIndex": 163
    },
    {
      "start": 543.887,
      "end": 547.138,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after he had said all these things,",
      "verse": "18:40",
      "lineIndex": 164
    },
    {
      "start": 547.318,
      "end": 549.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and expounded them to the king,",
      "verse": "18:40",
      "lineIndex": 165
    },
    {
      "start": 549.588,
      "end": 552.142,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the king believed all his words.",
      "verse": "18:40",
      "lineIndex": 166
    },
    {
      "start": 552.822,
      "end": 555.19,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he began to cry unto the Lord, saying:",
      "verse": "18:41",
      "lineIndex": 167
    },
    {
      "start": 555.37,
      "end": 556.392,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O Lord,",
      "verse": "18:41",
      "lineIndex": 168
    },
    {
      "start": 556.572,
      "end": 559.312,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "have mercy; according to thy abundant mercy",
      "verse": "18:41",
      "lineIndex": 169
    },
    {
      "start": 559.492,
      "end": 564.508,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which thou hast had upon the people of Nephi, have upon me, and my people.",
      "verse": "18:41",
      "lineIndex": 170
    },
    {
      "start": 565.188,
      "end": 567.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, when he had said this,",
      "verse": "18:42",
      "lineIndex": 171
    },
    {
      "start": 567.876,
      "end": 570.43,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he fell unto the earth, as if he were dead.",
      "verse": "18:42",
      "lineIndex": 172
    },
    {
      "start": 571.11,
      "end": 573.85,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that his servants took him",
      "verse": "18:43",
      "lineIndex": 173
    },
    {
      "start": 574.03,
      "end": 576.306,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and carried him in unto his wife,",
      "verse": "18:43",
      "lineIndex": 174
    },
    {
      "start": 576.486,
      "end": 578.297,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and laid him upon a bed;",
      "verse": "18:43",
      "lineIndex": 175
    },
    {
      "start": 578.477,
      "end": 583.493,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he lay as if he were dead for the space of two days and two nights;",
      "verse": "18:43",
      "lineIndex": 176
    },
    {
      "start": 583.673,
      "end": 591.661,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his wife, and his sons, and his daughters mourned over him, after the manner of the Lamanites, greatly lamenting his loss.",
      "verse": "18:43",
      "lineIndex": 177
    }
  ]
}